      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-032-wangyanzhi:line079",
      "start_codepoint": 20,
      "end_codepoint": 24,
      "source_quote": "舉秀才。",
      "reading": "被舉秀才。",
      "note": "被舉秀才。",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "qi32-yan-79-24-received_sentence",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABDABAACA",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-032-wangyanzhi:line079",
      "start_codepoint": 24,
      "end_codepoint": 53,
      "source_quote": "除北中郎法曹行參軍，轉署外兵尚書外兵部，司空主簿，竝不就。",
      "reading": "北中郎法曹行參軍、署外兵及司空主簿，末云竝不就。尚書外兵部字樣保留。",
      "note": "北中郎法曹行參軍、署外兵及司空主簿，末云竝不就。尚書外兵部字樣保留。",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "qi32-yan-79-53-received_sentence",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABDABAACA",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-032-wangyanzhi:line079",
      "start_codepoint": 53,
      "end_codepoint": 128,
      "source_quote": "除中軍建平王主簿、記室，仍度司空、北中郎二府，轉祕書丞，西陽王撫軍諮議，州別駕，尋陽王冠軍、安陸王後軍司馬，加振武將軍，出爲安遠護軍，武陵內史，不拜。",
      "reading": "建平王等府佐歷職，出安遠護軍、武陵內史未拜，依本句末語分別已歷與未就。",
      "note": "建平王等府佐歷職，出安遠護軍、武陵內史未拜，依本句末語分別已歷與未就。",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "qi32-yan-79-128-received_sentence",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABDABAACA",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-032-wangyanzhi:line079",
      "start_codepoint": 128,
      "end_codepoint": 148,
      "source_quote": "宋明帝爲衞軍，延之轉爲長史，加宣威將軍。",
      "reading": "宋明帝尚任衞軍時，延之任長史，加宣威。",
      "note": "宋明帝尚任衞軍時，延之任長史，加宣威。",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "qi32-yan-79-148-received_sentence",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABDABAACA",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-032-wangyanzhi:line079",
      "start_codepoint": 148,
      "end_codepoint": 173,
      "source_quote": "司徒建安王休仁征赭圻，轉延之爲左長史，加寧朔將軍。",
      "reading": "隨司徒建安王劉休仁征赭圻，轉左長史加寧朔。",
      "note": "隨司徒建安王劉休仁征赭圻，轉左長史加寧朔。",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "qi32-yan-81-0-received_sentence",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABDABAACA",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-032-wangyanzhi:line081",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 10,
      "source_quote": "延之清貧，居宇穿漏。",
      "reading": "居所漏雨，延之家貧。",
      "note": "居所漏雨，延之家貧。",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "qi32-yan-81-10-received_sentence",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABDABAACA",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-032-wangyanzhi:line081",
      "start_codepoint": 10,
      "end_codepoint": 38,
      "source_quote": "褚淵往候之，見其如此，具啓明帝，帝卽敕材官爲起三閒齋屋。",
      "reading": "褚淵訪延之，啟宋明帝，帝敕材官為延之營三閒齋屋。",
      "note": "褚淵訪延之，啟宋明帝，帝敕材官為延之營三閒齋屋。",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "qi32-yan-81-38-received_sentence",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABDABAACA",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-032-wangyanzhi:line081",
      "start_codepoint": 38,
      "end_codepoint": 58,
      "source_quote": "遷侍中，領射聲校尉，未拜，出爲吳郡太守。",
      "reading": "侍中、射聲校尉未拜，出守吳郡。",
      "note": "侍中、射聲校尉未拜，出守吳郡。",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
