      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABDABAACA",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-032-wangyanzhi:line081",
      "start_codepoint": 69,
      "end_codepoint": 86,
      "source_quote": "除吏部尚書，侍中，領右軍，竝不拜。",
      "reading": "吏部尚書、侍中、領右軍均未拜。",
      "note": "吏部尚書、侍中、領右軍均未拜。",
