      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-032-wangyanzhi:line081",
      "start_codepoint": 137,
      "end_codepoint": 154,
      "source_quote": "遷中書令，師如故，未拜，轉右僕射。",
      "reading": "中書令未拜，轉右僕射，王師仍故。",
      "note": "中書令未拜，轉右僕射，王師仍故。",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
