      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-032-wangyanzhi:line083",
      "start_codepoint": 20,
      "end_codepoint": 55,
      "source_quote": "延之與尚書令王僧虔中立無所去就，時人爲之語曰：「二王持平，不送不迎。」",
